{
  "_about": "Third-party components of the two Android apps' release classpaths. scripts/android_licenses.py fails when a runtime dependency matches no entry, and generates each app's res/raw/third_party_notices.txt from this file. 'match' is a list of fnmatch patterns on 'group:artifact'; the first matching entry wins. Texts of the licences are the files named under 'licenses'.",
